# Earthbeat UI conventions

Visual source of truth: `docs/earthbeat-ui-eggshell-minimal.png` and `docs/ui-conventions.md`.

## Colors

- Define raw colors only in `client/src/styles/tokens.css`
- In other CSS/TSX, use `var(--token)`, `currentColor`, or `transparent`
- Never add hex, `rgb()`, `hsl()`, or `color-mix()` outside tokens
- Accents: `--live` / `--destructive` only — no decorative palette

## Look

- Eggshell ground, plain black hairlines, flat fills
- No soft shadows, glows, gradients, glass, or neumorphism
- No “synth dashboard” chrome (colored knobs, skeuomorphic aluminum)

## Components

- Prefer existing shell class patterns in `client/src/index.css`
- When adding Tailwind/shadcn later, map to the same tokens; never use raw palette classes

## Verify

Run `pnpm --dir client lint` after UI changes (oxlint + stylelint + check-ui-colors).
